# Public, operator-approved MyAivan web entry (normally ending in /app).
# On CTYun, TCP 443 is owned by SSH: an https:// entry must include an explicit
# non-443 port, e.g. https://myaivan.com:8444/app. Any other free port is fine.
# Never put credentials, API keys, tenant IDs, or business data in this value.
VITE_MYAIVAN_URL=
